==Trivia==
This card's illustration features a [[Moon Stone]], an [[Evolution stone]] which can be used to evolve {{p|Jigglypuff}} into {{p|Wigglytuff}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Wigglytuff|56}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion.
*{{m|Hyper Voice}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Wigglytuff}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

